## Conversions

| From | To | Multiply by |
|---|---|---|
| inch | mm | 25.4 |
| mm | inch | 0.03937 |
| mil (0.001") | mm | 0.0254 |
| ft-lb | N·m | 1.356 |
| N·m | ft-lb | 0.7376 |
| in-lb | ft-lb | 0.0833 |
| psi | kPa | 6.895 |
| psi | bar | 0.0689 |
| hp | kW | 0.746 |
| kW | hp | 1.341 |
| lb | kg | 0.4536 |
